insert into questions (external_key, question_type, question_text, instructions, media, correct_answer, score_config, difficulty, category, tags, time_limit_seconds, required) values ('spatial-q7', ('pattern_question')::question_type, '3x3 grid, hard difficulty (category: Diagonal Logic). Shape cycles diagonally: row 1 is circle, square, triangle' || chr(59) || ' row 2 is square, triangle, circle' || chr(59) || ' row 3 is triangle, circle, [missing]. Each column has a fixed fill/size (col 1 = solid/large, col 2 = outline/medium, col 3 = striped/small) and each row has a fixed color (row 1 = indigo, row 2 = amber, row 3 = green). Continuing the diagonal shape cycle and column 3''s striped/small styling, the missing cell should be a small striped green square.', 'Track how the shape identity shifts diagonally row-to-row while color (by row) and fill/size (by column) stay fixed, then pick the option that completes the missing cell.', ('[]')::jsonb, NULL, ('[]')::jsonb, ('hard')::assessment_difficulty, 'spatial-intelligence', '{}'::text[], NULL, true)
