insert into questions (external_key, question_type, question_text, instructions, media, correct_answer, score_config, difficulty, category, tags, time_limit_seconds, required) values ('spatial-q9', ('pattern_question')::question_type, '3x3 grid, hard difficulty (category: Compound Rules). Shape, color, and fill pattern all rotate together diagonally: row 1 = orange solid circle (large), green striped square (medium), blue outline triangle (small)' || chr(59) || ' row 2 = green solid square (large), blue striped triangle (medium), orange outline circle (small)' || chr(59) || ' row 3 = blue solid triangle (large), orange striped circle (medium), [missing]. Size and fill are fixed per column (large/solid, medium/striped, small/outline) while shape and color cycle diagonally. The missing cell should be a small outline green square.', 'Track three simultaneous rules — shape rotation, color rotation, and column-fixed size/fill — then pick the option that completes the missing cell.', ('[]')::jsonb, NULL, ('[]')::jsonb, ('hard')::assessment_difficulty, 'spatial-intelligence', '{}'::text[], NULL, true)
